1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,000
Most videos on social media
are watched with the sound off.

2
00:00:04,310 --> 00:00:06,060
Subtitles keep those viewers.

3
00:00:07,217 --> 00:00:10,377
First, a speech model called
Whisper listens to the voice,

4
00:00:10,377 --> 00:00:14,147
and writes down every word
with the moment it was spoken.

5
00:00:15,183 --> 00:00:17,433
Then the words are
grouped into short lines.

6
00:00:17,778 --> 00:00:20,308
A new line starts wherever
the speaker pauses.

7
00:00:21,450 --> 00:00:24,180
Finally, the lines are
drawn onto the video.

8
00:00:24,445 --> 00:00:26,935
It all runs on your
own computer, for free.

